      "block_preview_text": "Mention the egalitarian nature of foraging communities, prioritizing resource access for survival. Explain the mobility and small community size of foragers to prevent overuse of resources. Describe the high degree of sustainability and adaptability of foraging societies. Introduce the kong who live in the Kalahari Desert and use various species of plants and animals for food. Describe how the kong's diet includes mangango nuts, a high-protein food source.",
