      ],
      "block_preview_text": "Explain their foraging strategy of eating desired foods first and then moving on to less desirable resources. Describe their seasonal mobility patterns, including large camps in the dry season and smaller groups in the rainy season. Mention the low number of possessions and limited population growth of the kong. Explain the egalitarian division of labor and sharing among the kong. Highlight the kong's bilateral kinship system.",
